---
---

<div class="space-y-3">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-rose-400/20 bg-rose-400/[0.03] p-3.5">
      <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
        <span class="font-mono text-[11px] font-medium text-rose-200/90">
          BST sin balancear
        </span>
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-rose-300/80">altura = N · O(N)</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[10px] text-dim">Inserción en orden: 10 → 20 → 30 → 40 → 50</p>

      <pre
        class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-white/5 bg-black/30 p-3 font-mono text-[11px] leading-5 text-rose-200/85">10
 └─ 20
     └─ 30
         └─ 40
             └─ 50  ← 5 saltos</pre>

      <p class="mt-2.5 text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-dim">
        Degenera en una lista enlazada cara: pagas memoria de dos punteros por nodo y recorres todo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-lg border accent-border accent-softer p-3.5">
      <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
        <span class="font-mono text-[11px] font-medium accent">
          Árbol AVL (auto-balanceado)
        </span>
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-muted">altura = ⌊log₂N⌋ · O(log N)</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[10px] text-dim">Misma inserción + rotaciones O(1)</p>

      <pre
        class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-white/5 bg-black/30 p-3 font-mono text-[11px] leading-5 text-ink/90">      30
     /  \
   20    40
  /        \
10          50      ← máx 3 saltos</pre>

      <p class="mt-2.5 text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-dim">
        Invariante AVL: <span class="font-mono text-muted">|altura(izq) − altura(der)| ≤ 1</span> en
        todo nodo. Con 1.000.000 de claves, nunca supera ~20 comparaciones.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Las 4 rotaciones canónicas del AVL -->
  <div class="rounded-lg border border-white/8 bg-black/25 p-3.5">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/8 pb-2">
      <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-ink">Las 4 Rotaciones de Rebalanceo O(1)</span>
      <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-dim">FE = altura(der) − altura(izq)</span>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-1 gap-2.5 sm:grid-cols-2 text-[10px] font-mono">
      <!-- 1. RSD -->
      <div class="rounded-md border border-white/6 bg-white/[0.015] p-2.5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-indigo-300 font-semibold">
          <span>1. RSD (Simple Derecha)</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px]">Caso II</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-1 text-dim text-[9px]">Inserción en subárbol izquierdo de hijo izquierdo.</p>
        <pre class="mt-2 text-ink/90 bg-black/30 p-2 rounded border border-white/5 leading-4">    (C) [-2]              (B) [0]
    /   \                 /     \
  (B)   T3    ──►       (A)     (C)
  / \                   / \     / \
(A)  T2                T0 T1   T2 T3</pre>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. RSI -->
      <div class="rounded-md border border-white/6 bg-white/[0.015] p-2.5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-indigo-300 font-semibold">
          <span>2. RSI (Simple Izquierda)</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px]">Caso DD</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-1 text-dim text-[9px]">Inserción en subárbol derecho de hijo derecho.</p>
        <pre class="mt-2 text-ink/90 bg-black/30 p-2 rounded border border-white/5 leading-4">    (A) [+2]              (B) [0]
    /   \                 /     \
   T0   (B)   ──►       (A)     (C)
        / \             / \     / \
       T1 (C)          T0 T1   T2 T3</pre>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. RDID -->
      <div class="rounded-md border border-white/6 bg-white/[0.015] p-2.5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-emerald-300 font-semibold">
          <span>3. RDID (Doble Izq-Der)</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-emerald-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px]">Caso ID</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-1 text-dim text-[9px]">RSI en hijo (B) + RSD en raíz (C) (zig-zag).</p>
        <pre class="mt-2 text-ink/90 bg-black/30 p-2 rounded border border-white/5 leading-4">   (C) [-2]              (X) [0]
   /   \                 /     \
 (B)   T3    ──►       (B)     (C)
   \                   / \     / \
   (X)                T0 T1   T2 T3</pre>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. RDDI -->
      <div class="rounded-md border border-white/6 bg-white/[0.015] p-2.5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-emerald-300 font-semibold">
          <span>4. RDDI (Doble Der-Izq)</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-emerald-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px]">Caso DI</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-1 text-dim text-[9px]">RSD en hijo (C) + RSI en raíz (A) (zig-zag).</p>
        <pre class="mt-2 text-ink/90 bg-black/30 p-2 rounded border border-white/5 leading-4">   (A) [+2]              (X) [0]
   /   \                 /     \
  T0   (C)   ──►       (A)     (C)
       /               / \     / \
     (X)              T0 T1   T2 T3</pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
